-integrity relationship.","expected_behavior":"The deployed artifact can be traced to the artifact whose evidence was evaluated.","failure_mode":"Different artifact versions are treated as the same deployment.","expected_error":"DEPLOYED_ARTIFACT_IDENTITY_MISMATCH","security_implication":"Artifact substitution can invalidate security verification.","performance_implication":"Different artifacts can produce different runtime behavior and performance.","testing_method":"Artifact identity and integrity review.","test_input":"Deployment record with artifact name but no stable identity relationship.","expected_test_result":"Artifact integrity remains unresolved.","verification_method":"Compare stable artifact identifiers and available integrity evidence.","validation_status":"GENERATED","execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","evidence_level":"METHODOLOGY","confidence":"HIGH","provenance":"operational_experience_dataset_methodology","relationships":["refines:D50-B13-R001"],"related_records":[]} {"record_id":"D50-B13-R003","dataset_id":"D50","batch_id":"B13","topic":"Successful Projects","subtopic":"Configuration Deployment","concept":"Deployment success must preserve material environment configuration because successful behavior may depend on deployment-time configuration.","knowledge_type":"CONFIGURATION_RULE","objective":"Make deployment outcomes reproducible and correctly bounded.","requirements":["Material deployment configuration must be recorded.","Configuration source must be identifiable where relevant.","Observed result must remain tied to the effective configuration."],"constraints":["Do not assume source configuration equals effective configuration.","Do not fabricate deployment configuration."],"prerequisites":["Deployment evidence","configuration context"],"dependencies":["D50-B06-R002","D50-B13-R001"],"input":"Deployment outcome and effective configuration.","output":"Configuration-qualified deployment success record.","expected_behavior":"The record preserves th