."],"constraints":["Documentation existence alone does not prove successful knowledge transfer."],"input":"Project documentation, code, operational procedures, representative maintenance task.","output":"Knowledge-transfer evidence with explicit boundaries.","expected_behavior":"A qualified independent maintainer can complete the defined task using the available project knowledge and declared prerequisites.","failure_mode":"Critical behavior depends on undocumented individual knowledge.","root_cause":"Knowledge concentration, incomplete documentation, or implicit conventions.","testing_method":"Have an independent qualified maintainer perform a defined task without undocumented assistance.","test_input":"Project artifact and documentation plus representative maintenance task.","expected_test_result":"Task completes according to acceptance criteria with only declared prerequisites.","verification_method":"Record task outcome and compare required assistance against the documented knowledge base.","validation_status":"REQUIRES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC_EVIDENCE","execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","provenance":["ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207:2017","ISO/IEC/IEEE 25010:2023"],"relationships":[{"type":"extends","record_id":"D50-B66-R001"},{"type":"related_to","record_id":"D50-B69-R003"}]} {"record_id":"D50-B66-R005","dataset_id":"D50","topic":"Successful Projects","subtopic":"Maintainability","concept":"Testability evidence","knowledge_type":"operational_engineering_evidence","objective":"Capture whether important project behaviors can be exercised and verified with practical test mechanisms.","requirements":["Identify behaviors requiring verification.","Identify available test interfaces or fixtures.","Record setup prerequisites.","Record observed test outcomes."],"constraints":["A large test suite does not automatically establish testability."],"input":"System behavior, test interfaces, fixtures, and test results.","output":"Behavior-specific testability evidence.","expected_behavior":"Defined critical behaviors can be exercised under controlled conditions with interpretable results.","failure_mode":"Critical behavior cannot be reliably isolated or verified.","root_cause":"Tight coupling, unavailable interfaces, nondeterminism, hidden state, or missing fixtures.","testing_method":"Execute representative tests for critical behaviors and record setup complexity and observability.","test_input":"Defined behavior-specific test scenario.","expected_test_result":"Expected behavior can be exercised and its result determined from available evidence.","verification_method":"Review test setup, execution evidence, and result interpretation.","validation_status":"REQUIRES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC_EVIDENCE","execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","provenance":["ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119 Software Testing","ISO/IEC/IEEE 25010:2023"],"relationships":[{"type":"extends","record_id":"D50-B66-R002"},{"type":"related_to","record_id":"D50-B63-R003"}]} {"record_id":"D50-B67-R001","dataset_id":"D50","topic":"Successful Projects","subtopic":"Security","concept":"Security evidence boundary","knowledge_type":"operational_engineering_evidence","objective":"Record exactly which security properties were demonstrated by the successful project evidence.","requirements":["Identify security property.","Identify verification method.","Identify tested scope.","Record unresolved security assumptions."],"constraints":["Functional success does not establish security.","A security test result applies only to its tested scope and conditions."],"input":"Security requirement, test or analysis evidence, project scope.","output":"Bounded security-success record.","expected_behavior":"Security claims are limited to properties and conditions supported by evidence.","failure_mode":"General security claims are inferred from functional success.","root_cause":"Scope inflation or conflation of functionality and security.","testing_method":"Map each security claim to a corresponding test, analysis, review, or other evidence.