nal procedure.","Identify required inputs and permissions.","Define observable success criteria.","Record exercise evidence."],"constraints":["A prose procedure remains unverified until exercised or otherwise validated."],"input":"Operational procedure and defined task.","output":"Executable or testable operational knowledge record.","expected_behavior":"The procedure can be followed using declared prerequisites and produces observable acceptance evidence.","failure_mode":"Procedure omits hidden prerequisites or relies on undocumented operator knowledge.","root_cause":"Procedure authored from intent rather than validated operation.","testing_method":"Execute the procedure in a controlled environment.","test_input":"Procedure, prerequisites, and representative operational state.","expected_test_result":"The documented task completes according to acceptance criteria.","verification_method":"Compare actual execution steps and prerequisites with the documented procedure.","validation_status":"REQUIRES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC_EVIDENCE","execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","provenance":["ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207:2017","ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119"],"relationships":[{"type":"specializes","record_id":"D50-B69-R001"},{"type":"requires","record_id":"D50-B61-R001"}]} {"record_id":"D50-B69-R004","dataset_id":"D50","topic":"Successful Projects","subtopic":"Handoff","concept":"Handoff exception register","knowledge_type":"operational_engineering_evidence","objective":"Preserve unresolved transfer issues without misclassifying the project as either fully failed or fully complete.","requirements":["Record each exception.","Classify severity and operational effect.","Identify owner or next action.","Record verification status."],"constraints":["An unresolved handoff exception must remain visible to downstream reasoning."],"input":"Handoff review findings.","output":"Structured exception register linked to the project success record.","expected_behavior":"Known transfer gaps remain queryable and are not lost