enance actions to the evidence showing that they preserved or restored required outcomes.","requirements":["Identify maintenance action.","Identify affected success criterion.","Record before and after evidence.","Record action provenance."],"constraints":["Maintenance action must not be credited with preserving success without supporting observations."],"input":"Maintenance event and outcome observations.","output":"Action-to-preserved-outcome relationship.","expected_behavior":"The system can identify which maintenance actions were associated with preservation of specific outcomes.","failure_mode":"Maintenance history exists but its effect on project outcomes cannot be determined.","root_cause":"Actions and outcome evidence were not linked.","testing_method":"Perform a controlled maintenance change and compare relevant outcome evidence.","test_input":"Maintenance action and success criteria.","expected_test_result":"Outcome evidence is captured before and after the action.","verification_method":"Trace action, artifact state, tests, and outcome observations.","validation_status":"REQUIRES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC_EVIDENCE","execution_status":"NOT_EXECUTED","provenance":["ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207:2017","ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119"],"relationships":[{"type":"extends","record_id":"D50-B64-R001"},{"type":"related_to","record_id":"D50-B75-R002"}]} {"record_id":"D50-B75-R004","dataset_id":"D50","topic":"Successful Projects","subtopic":"Longitudinal Learning","concept":"Environmental-change impact on success","knowledge_type":"context_change_evidence","objective":"Determine whether external environmental changes alter the validity of a previously successful project state.","requirements":["Record original environmental assumptions.","Detect material environment changes.","Assess affected requirements and dependencies.","Record revalidation status."],"constraints":["Environmental change does not automatically invalidate success; impact must be evidenced or marked unknown."],"input":"Historical